      "statement": "Label inference is deterministic: infer_priority maps labels to P0 (critical/blocker/security/hotfix), P1 (high/major/bug), P3 (low/trivial/nice-to-have) defaulting to P2, and infer_category maps labels to security/performance/bug-fix/refactoring/documentation/testing/config, defaulting to 'feature' when the inferred issue type is a feature, else 'bug-fix'; infer_issue_type infers bug/feature from raw tracker fields, labels, then title prefixes.",
